OL,3,GNEWSANature spot fears over plan for 35
OL,4,Anew homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial proposal to build 35
OL,7,Fnew homes looks set to be approved
OL,8,Fdespite concerns about the impact on a
OL,9,Fnearby nature spot.
OL,11,FThe properties would be built on the
OL,12,Foutskirts of Wymondham, Norfolk but
OL,13,Fopponents are concerned about the
OL,14,Fpotential impact on marshes in the
OL,15,Farea.
OL,17,FThe development, planned for land next
OL,18,Fto a repair garage on London Road,
OL,19,Fincludes 12 affordable homes and space
OL,20,Ffor a new car showroom and offices.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
